            ("Advanced health facilities", "We have taken care of the health side through air purifiers, water-resistant flooring, and separating the assembly area from the play area to reduce crowding and mixing, along with making the most of natural light. Add to that smart touch-free washrooms — from soap to tissues and hand dryers — all reinforcing a healthy, safe environment for our children.", "blue"),
            ("Qualified teachers", "Our children are supervised by qualified Saudi teachers, with two specialist teachers alternating in every class: one for Arabic and the other for English, so each child receives a high-quality, balanced education that meets the needs of every stage of growth from the earliest years.", "teal"),
