                  ("الثلاثاء", "التطبيق والمشاركة العملية.") };

    var ac_variety = isEn
        ? "Activities span scientific, cultural, religious, sporting, artistic and social fields, through a plan that keeps renewing itself across the school year."
        : "وتتنوع الأنشطة بين المجالات العلمية، والثقافية، والدينية، والرياضية، والفنية، والاجتماعية، من خلال خطة متجددة طوال العام الدراسي.";

    var ac_closing = isEn
        ? "What sets Dalat's activities apart is that they are for everyone. We don't rely on fixed teams or limit them to students already gifted in one field — we encourage every student to take part and to try, so each one has the chance to grow her skills, discover her capabilities, and strengthen her confidence in herself."
